# Keep Docker build contexts small and prevent local secrets from entering images.
.git
**/.git
node_modules
**/node_modules
.next
**/.next
dist
**/dist
coverage
**/coverage
.env*
**/.env*
*.pem
**/*.pem
*.key
**/*.key
id_rsa*
**/id_rsa*
id_ed25519*
**/id_ed25519*
*.p12
**/*.p12
*.pfx
**/*.pfx
.ssh
**/.ssh
backups
**/backups
